  "open_work": [
    "Three original fixed-glass source records retain plans, centres and vertical envelopes; 60/120/30mm placeholder depths become 8/8/6mm physical sheet. Source mullions, piers, sill/head, band, doors and all openings retain their owners. Seven wall/frame contacts are sampled; structural capacity, sealing and service continuity remain separate duties.",
